#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:5
msgid "Roles"
msgstr "Vloge"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:9
msgid "What a user is allowed to do in Galette is described by **permissions**, such as *Display members*, *Create contributions* or *Send mailings*. Permissions are not given one by one to users: they are gathered in **roles**, and roles are given to members."
msgstr ""
"Kaj lahko uporabnik v sistemu Galette počne, določajo **dovoljenja**, kot so "
"*Prikaz članov*, *Ustvarjanje prispevkov* ali *Pošiljanje sporočil*. "
"Dovoljenja se uporabnikom ne dodeljujejo posamično, temveč so združena v "
"**vloge**, te vloge pa se dodelijo članom."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:11
msgid "Some roles are given automatically, from members information: they reproduce the access levels of previous versions (members, group managers, staff members, administrators). You can change their permissions, and create your own roles, for a treasurer or a secretary for instance, to give to whom you choose, for all the groups or for one group only."
msgstr ""
"Nekatere vloge se dodelijo samodejno na podlagi podatkov o članih; te vloge "
"odražajo ravni dostopa iz prejšnjih različic (člani, vodje skupin, osebje, "
"administratorji). Njihova dovoljenja lahko spremenite, prav tako pa lahko "
"ustvarite lastne vloge – na primer za blagajnika ali tajnika – in jih "
"dodelite poljubnim osebam, bodisi za vse skupine bodisi samo za eno določeno "
"skupino."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:13
msgid "Roles are managed from **Configuration**, then **Roles**. This page requires the *Manage roles and their permissions* permission, which only administrators have by default."
msgstr ""
"Vloge se upravljajo v razdelku **Konfiguracija** in nato **Vloge**. Za "
"dostop do te strani je potrebno dovoljenje *Upravljanje vlog in njihovih "
"pravic*, ki ga imajo privzeto le administratorji."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:16
msgid "System roles"
msgstr "Sistemske vloge"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:18
msgid "Five roles are given from members information; they cannot be renamed, removed nor given by hand:"
msgstr ""
"Na podlagi podatkov o članih je določenih pet vlog; teh ni mogoče "
"preimenovati, odstraniti ali dodeliti ročno:"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:24
#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:156
msgid "Role"
msgstr "Vloga"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:25
msgid "Given to"
msgstr "Podeljeno"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:26
msgid "Inherits from"
msgstr "Podedovano"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:27
msgid "**Member**"
msgstr "**Član**"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:28
msgid "any logged in member"
msgstr "kateri koli prijavljeni član"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:30
msgid "**Up to date member**"
msgstr "**Posodobljen član**,"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:31
msgid "members whose account is active and whose membership is up to date"
msgstr "člani, katerih račun je aktiven in katerih članstvo je urejeno"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:32
#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:35
#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:38
#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:159
msgid "Member"
msgstr "Član"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:33
msgid "**Group manager**"
msgstr "**Vodja skupine**"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:34
msgid "managers of a group, on the groups they manage only"
msgstr "vodje skupine, in sicer le za skupine, ki jih vodijo"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:36
msgid "**Staff member**"
msgstr "**Član osebja**"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:37
msgid "members with a staff status (President, Treasurer, Secretary...)"
msgstr "člani s statusom funkcionarja (predsednik, blagajnik, tajnik ...)"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:39
msgid "**Administrator**"
msgstr "**Skrbnik**"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:40
msgid "members for who the *administrator* checkbox has been checked"
msgstr "člani, pri katerih je označeno potrditveno polje *administrator*"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:41
msgid "Staff member"
msgstr "Član osebja"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:43
msgid "A role **inherits** the permissions of its parent: an administrator gets every permission of staff members, and those of members. The page of a system role tells where it comes from, and lists the administrators, staff members or group managers who have it, each group manager once with all the groups they manage. **Member** and **Up to date member** are given to nearly every member: their page only tells how many have them."
msgstr ""
"Vloga **podeduje** dovoljenja svoje nadrejene vloge: administrator pridobi "
"vsa dovoljenja, ki jih imajo člani osebja, ter dovoljenja, ki jih imajo "
"člani. Na strani sistemske vloge je naveden njen izvor, prav tako pa so "
"našteti administratorji, člani osebja ali vodje skupin, ki to vlogo imajo – "
"pri čemer je vsak vodja skupin naveden enkrat, skupaj z vsemi skupinami, ki "
"jih upravlja. Vlogi **član** in **posodobljen član** sta dodeljeni skoraj "
"vsakemu članu; na njunih straneh je navedeno le število oseb, ki jima je "
"bila vloga dodeljena."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:45
msgid "On a new installation, system roles get what access levels allowed before:"
msgstr ""
"Pri novi namestitvi sistemske vloge prejmejo ravni dostopa, ki so bile "
"dovoljene že prej:"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:47
msgid "**Member** and **Up to date member**: no permission. Members still see and edit their own information, and see their own contributions and transactions, see :ref:`below <roles_own>`,"
msgstr ""
"**Član** in **Član z urejenim statusom**: brez dovoljenja. Člani lahko še "
"vedno vidijo in urejajo svoje podatke ter si ogledajo svoje prispevke in "
"transakcije; glejte :ref:`spodaj <roles_own>`,"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:48
msgid "**Group manager**: display the members and the groups they manage, export those members as CSV, print their cards, labels and attendance sheets, export their groups as PDF,"
msgstr ""
"**Upravitelj skupin**: prikažite člane in skupine, ki jih upravljajo, "
"izvozite te člane kot CSV, natisnite njihove kartice, nalepke in liste "
"prisotnosti, izvozite njihove skupine kot PDF,"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:49
msgid "**Staff member**: everything about members but *Create child members*, which no role has by default, contributions, transactions, groups, mailings and documents, references lists (statuses, titles, contributions and payment types), emails contents and PDF models, data exports, logs and system information,"
msgstr ""
"**Član osebja**: vse v zvezi s člani – razen *ustvarjanja podrejenih članov* "
"(pravice, ki je privzeto nima nobena vloga) –, prispevki, transakcije, "
"skupine, pošiljanje sporočil in dokumenti, referenčni seznami (statusi, "
"nazivi, vrste prispevkov in plačil), vsebine e-poštnih sporočil in predloge "
"za PDF-dokumente, izvozi podatkov, dnevniki in sistemske informacije,"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:50
msgid "**Administrator**: in addition, grant administrator rights to members, settings, fields configuration, authentication restrictions, plugins and roles."
msgstr ""
"**Administrator**: poleg tega dodelite skrbniške pravice za člane, "
"nastavitve, konfiguracijo polj, omejitve preverjanja pristnosti, vtičnike in "
"vloge."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:52
msgid "When upgrading, they get what your former settings allowed, see :ref:`roles_upgrade`."
msgstr ""
"Pri nadgradnji prejmejo tisto, kar so omogočale vaše prejšnje nastavitve; "
"glejte :ref:`roles_upgrade`."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:54
msgid "The **super administrator** is not a member, and has no role: it is always granted everything."
msgstr ""
"**Superadministrator** ni član in nima nobene vloge: vedno ima podeljena vsa "
"pooblastila."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:59
msgid "What members own"
msgstr "V lasti članov"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:61
msgid "Some permissions are always granted on what a member owns: their own information, contributions and transactions, and those of their children. They are flagged **Always on own** in the permissions lists. This cannot be changed: a member can always see their own card, even if the **Member** role has no permission at all. Printing their own membership card still depends on the **Allow members to print card ?** preference."
msgstr ""
"Za vsebine, ki so v lasti člana – torej njegove lastne podatke, prispevke in "
"transakcije ter podatke, prispevke in transakcije njegovih otrok – so "
"določena dovoljenja vedno dodeljena. Na seznamih dovoljenj so ta označena z "
"oznako **Vedno za lastno vsebino**. Tega ni mogoče spremeniti: član lahko "
"vedno vidi svojo lastno kartico, tudi če vloga **Član** nima dodeljenega "
"nobenega dovoljenja. Možnost tiskanja lastne članske izkaznice pa je še "
"vedno odvisna od nastavitve **Ali lahko člani natisnejo izkaznico?**."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:64
msgid "Roles list and edition"
msgstr "Seznam in urejanje vlog"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:66
msgid "The roles list displays each role, the role it inherits from, the number of permissions it grants (inherited ones are not counted) and how many members have it. System roles are flagged as such."
msgstr ""
"Seznam vlog prikazuje posamezno vlogo, od katere ta podeduje lastnosti, "
"število dovoljenj, ki jih dodeljuje (podedovana dovoljenja niso všteta), ter "
"število članov, ki jim je dodeljena. Sistemske vloge so ustrezno označene."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:68
msgid "Roles list"
msgstr "Seznam vlog"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:73
msgid "Type a name at the bottom of the list and use **Add** to create a role; you can choose the role it inherits from. A role can inherit from a system role or from another role you have created; a parent that would make the role inherit from itself is refused."
msgstr ""
"Na dnu seznama vnesite ime in s klikom na **Dodaj** ustvarite vlogo; "
"izberete lahko tudi vlogo, od katere bo nova vloga podedovala lastnosti. "
"Vloga lahko podeduje lastnosti od sistemske vloge ali od druge vloge, ki ste "
"jo ustvarili; sistem ne dovoli izbire nadrejene vloge, zaradi katere bi "
"vloga podedovala lastnosti od same sebe."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:75
msgid "Editing a role displays its name, how many permissions it grants (inherited ones included), how many it inherits from its parent role, and how many members have it; the pencil icons rename the role and change its parent. Permissions are gathered by domain (members, contributions, transactions, groups, mailings, configuration...), each in a section telling how many of its permissions are granted; sections with granted permissions are open. Switch on the permissions the role grants, and **Save**. Permissions the role inherits from its parent are switched on and cannot be switched off here: change the parent role instead. For a system role, only its permissions can be changed."
msgstr ""
"Urejanje vloge prikaže njeno ime, koliko dovoljenj podeljuje (vključno s "
"podedovanimi), koliko jih podeduje od nadrejene vloge in koliko članov jo "
"ima; ikone svinčnikov preimenujejo vlogo in spremenijo njenega nadrejenega. "
"Dovoljenja so zbrana po domenah (člani, prispevki, transakcije, skupine, "
"poštna sporočila, konfiguracija ...), pri čemer vsaka v razdelku pove, "
"koliko dovoljenj je dodeljenih; razdelki z dodeljenimi dovoljenji so odprti. "
"Vklopite dovoljenja, ki jih vloga podeljuje, in kliknite **Shrani**. "
"Dovoljenja, ki jih vloga podeduje od nadrejenega, so vklopljena in jih tukaj "
"ni mogoče izklopiti: namesto tega spremenite nadrejeno vlogo. Za sistemsko "
"vlogo je mogoče spremeniti samo njena dovoljenja."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:77
msgid "Role edition, permissions by domain"
msgstr "Urejanje vlog, dovoljenja po domenah"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:82
msgid "Plugins may add their own permissions, in a domain of their own. Permissions of a plugin you disable are kept, and come back when the plugin is enabled again."
msgstr ""
"Vstavki lahko dodajo lastna dovoljenja v svojem lastnem domenskem prostoru. "
"Dovoljenja vstavka, ki ga onemogočite, se ohranijo in znova postanejo "
"aktivna, ko vstavek znova omogočite."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:84
msgid "When a new permission appears, from a plugin enabled later or from a newer version of Galette, system roles get it once, as their default permissions would. If you remove it from a role afterwards, it is not given back."
msgstr ""
"Ko se pojavi novo dovoljenje – bodisi zaradi vtičnika, ki je bil omogočen "
"kasneje, bodisi zaradi novejše različice sistema Galette – ga sistemske "
"vloge prejmejo enkrat, tako kot bi prejele svoja privzeta dovoljenja. Če ga "
"pozneje iz določene vloge odstranite, se vanjo ne vrne več."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:87
msgid "Giving a role"
msgstr "Dodeljevanje vloge"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:89
msgid "Roles you have created are given from their edition page, in the **Members** block beside the permissions: choose a member, a group or **All groups**, and use **Give role**. The same role can be given to a member for several groups. The trash icon takes a role back. Roles can also be given when editing a member, see below."
msgstr ""
"Vloge, ki ste jih ustvarili, lahko dodelite na strani za urejanje, v "
"razdelku **Člani** poleg dovoljenj: izberite člana, skupino ali **Vse "
"skupine** in uporabite možnost **Dodeli vlogo**. Ista vloga se lahko članu "
"dodeli v okviru več skupin. Z ikono smetnjaka lahko vlogo odvzamete. Vloge "
"lahko dodelite tudi med urejanjem posameznega člana – glejte spodaj."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:91
msgid "Members a role has been given to"
msgstr "Članom je bila dodeljena vloga"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:96
msgid "Changes apply at once: there is no need for the member to log in again."
msgstr "Spremembe začnejo veljati takoj: članu se ni treba znova prijaviti."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:98
msgid "Users who can manage roles see the roles of a member on their card: those computed from member information, with a cog icon, and those you have given, in blue. Each one links to the role page."
msgstr ""
"Uporabniki, ki lahko upravljajo vloge, na kartici člana vidijo njegove "
"vloge: tiste, ki so izračunane na podlagi podatkov o članu (označene z ikono "
"zobnika), in tiste, ki ste jih dodelili vi (prikazane v modri barvi). Vsaka "
"od njih vodi na stran zadevne vloge."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:100
msgid "Roles on a member card"
msgstr "Vloge na članski izkaznici"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:105
msgid "When editing an existing member, the **Roles** block lists the same roles, and where computed ones come from. Those cannot be changed there: **Administrator** follows the *Galette Admin* field of the form. Choose one of the roles you have created, a group or **All groups**, and use **Add**; the cross takes a given role back, and **Cancel** keeps it. Changes are stored when the member is saved. The block is not displayed when creating a member: give roles once the member has been saved."
msgstr ""
"Pri urejanju obstoječega člana blok **Vloge** navaja iste vloge in od kod "
"prihajajo izračunane. Teh tam ni mogoče spremeniti: **Administrator** sledi "
"polju *Galette Admin* v obrazcu. Izberite eno od vlog, ki ste jih ustvarili, "
"skupino ali **Vse skupine**, in uporabite **Dodaj**; križec prevzame dano "
"vlogo nazaj, **Prekliči** pa jo ohrani. Spremembe se shranijo, ko je član "
"shranjen. Blok se ne prikaže pri ustvarjanju člana: vloge dodelite, ko je "
"član shranjen."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:107
msgid "Roles when editing a member"
msgstr "Vloge pri urejanju člana"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:113
msgid "Roles for one group"
msgstr "Vloge za eno skupino"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:115
msgid "A role given for one group grants its permissions on the members of that group only, as for group managers: on their information, their contributions and their transactions. The lists of members, contributions and transactions only display those members. Groups are not inherited: a role for a group does not cover its subgroups."
msgstr ""
"Vloga, dodeljena določeni skupini, podeljuje dovoljenja, ki veljajo "
"izključno za člane te skupine – oziroma, v primeru vodij skupin, za njihove "
"podatke, prispevke in transakcije. Seznami članov, prispevkov in transakcij "
"prikazujejo le te člane. Lastnosti skupin se ne prenašajo: vloga, dodeljena "
"skupini, ne velja tudi za njene podskupine."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:119
msgid "Some permissions do not apply to members: creating groups, browsing sent mailings, managing documents, settings, fields configuration, references lists, emails contents and PDF models, logs, system information, authentication restrictions, plugins and roles. They have no meaning on a group, and are **not granted** by a role given for one group; the role page flags them **Not on a group**. Give such permissions in roles you give for all groups."
msgstr ""
"Nekatera dovoljenja za člane ne veljajo: ustvarjanje skupin, pregledovanje "
"poslanih sporočil, upravljanje dokumentov, nastavitve, konfiguracija polj, "
"seznami referenc, vsebina e-poštnih sporočil in predloge PDF, dnevniki, "
"sistemske informacije, omejitve preverjanja pristnosti, vtičniki ter vloge. "
"V kontekstu skupine nimajo nobenega pomena in se **ne dodelijo** prek vloge, "
"ki je določena za posamezno skupino; na strani z vlogami so označena z "
"opombo **Ni na voljo za skupino**. Tovrstna dovoljenja vključite v vloge, ki "
"jih dodelite za vse skupine."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:121
msgid "Some others would reach beyond the group, and are not granted for one group either: granting administrator rights, sending reminders to late members, importing members and exporting data. The role page flags them the same way."
msgstr ""
"Nekatere druge funkcije segajo onkraj okvira posamezne skupine in niso "
"vezane zgolj nanjo; to so: dodeljevanje skrbniških pravic, pošiljanje "
"opomnikov članom, ki zamujajo, uvoz članov ter izvoz podatkov. Na strani z "
"vlogami so te funkcije označene na enak način."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:123
msgid "The lists also display the user and their children, as their own information is always reachable."
msgstr ""
"Seznami prikazujejo tudi uporabnika in njegove otroke, saj so njihovi "
"podatki vedno dostopni."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:125
msgid "With *Manage members administrative information* for a group, the status of its members can be changed, but staff statuses (President, Treasurer, Secretary...) can only be given or taken back by a role given for all groups. When editing a member, the groups they manage can only be changed for the groups the role is given for."
msgstr ""
"S funkcijo *Upravljanje administrativnih podatkov o članih* v skupini je "
"mogoče spreminjati status njenih članov, vendar pa lahko funkcije "
"(predsednik, blagajnik, tajnik ...) članom podeli ali odvzame le oseba, ki "
"ima za to dodeljeno posebno vlogo, veljavno za vse skupine. Pri urejanju "
"člana je mogoče upravljana članstva v skupinah spreminjati le za tiste "
"skupine, za katere ima uporabnik dodeljeno ustrezno vlogo."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:127
msgid "A contribution of a group member may be part of a transaction of someone outside the group. Such a transaction is not displayed: the contribution stays attached to it when saved, and its amount cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
"Prispevek člana skupine je lahko del transakcije osebe, ki ni član skupine. "
"Takšna transakcija ni prikazana: prispevek ostane ob shranjevanju povezan z "
"njo, njegovega zneska pa ni mogoče spremeniti."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:130
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Primeri"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:132
msgid "A treasurer"
msgstr "Blagajnik"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:133
msgid "Create a *Treasurer* role with all the permissions of the **Contributions** and **Transactions** domains, and *Display members* so the members can be chosen in forms. Give this to the member in charge, onto all groups. They will not be able to edit members."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarite vlogo *Blagajnik* z vsemi dovoljenji na področjih **Prispevki** in "
"**Transakcije** ter z dovoljenjem *Prikaz članov*, ki omogoča izbiro članov "
"v obrazcih. To vlogo dodelite pristojnemu članu za vse skupine. Ta oseba ne "
"bo mogla urejati podatkov o članih."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:135
msgid "A secretary for a section"
msgstr "Tajnik oddelka"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:136
msgid "Create a *Section secretary* role with *Display members*, *Edit members*, *Display groups* and *Send mailings*. Give it for the section group: the member can update the information of the section members and write to them, and nobody else."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarite vlogo *tajnik sekcije* s pravicami *prikaz članov*, *urejanje "
"članov*, *prikaz skupin* in *pošiljanje sporočil*. To vlogo dodelite skupini "
"sekcije: član lahko posodablja podatke o članih sekcije in jim piše, nihče "
"drug pa tega ne more storiti."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:138
msgid "Members who register their children"
msgstr "Člani, ki prijavijo svoje otroke"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:139
msgid "Check *Create child members* in the **Member** role: every logged in member gets an **Add a child member** entry; created members are attached to them as children."
msgstr ""
"V vlogi **Član** označite možnost *Ustvari podrejene člane*: vsak prijavljen "
"član dobi vnos **Dodaj podrejenega člana**; ustvarjeni člani so mu dodeljeni "
"kot podrejeni."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:141
msgid "Group managers who update their members"
msgstr "Vodje skupin, ki posodabljajo svoje člane"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:142
msgid "Check *Edit members* in the **Group manager** role: every group manager can then edit the members of the groups they manage."
msgstr ""
"V vlogi **upravitelja skupine** označite možnost *Uredi člane* – tako lahko "
"vsak upravitelj skupine ureja člane skupin, ki jih upravlja."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:147
msgid "Upgrading from 1.3"
msgstr "Nadgradnja z različice 1.3"

