#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:189
msgid "Nothing changes for users: everyone keeps what they were allowed to do. After the upgrade, open **Configuration**, then **Roles**, and check that **Group manager** and **Member** roles match what you expect."
msgstr ""
"Za uporabnike se nič ne spremeni: vsi obdržijo pravice, ki so jih imeli "
"doslej. Po nadgradnji odprite **Konfiguracijo** (Configuration), nato "
"**Vloge** (Roles) in preverite, ali vlogi **Vodja skupine** (Group manager) "
"in **Član** (Member) ustrezata vašim pričakovanjem."

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:191
msgid "A few differences with previous versions:"
msgstr "Nekaj razlik v primerjavi s prejšnjimi različicami:"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:193
msgid "staff members now see the **Configuration** menu, with the references lists and the emails and PDF models they could already reach,"
msgstr ""
"Zaposleni zdaj vidijo meni **Konfiguracija** s seznami referenc ter e-"
"poštnimi naslovi in modeli PDF, do katerih so že lahko dostopali,"

#: ../usermanual/roles.rst:194
msgid "*Create members* and *Create child members* are two permissions: a member allowed to register their children no longer sees **Add a member**."
msgstr ""
"*Ustvarjanje članov* in *Ustvarjanje podrejenih članov* sta dve dovoljenji: "
"član, ki sme registrirati svoje otroke, ne vidi več možnosti **Dodaj člana**."

